  "releaseNotes": "Birds have different sounds throughout the year. Merlin now highlights seasonally relevant recordings, so you can learn how birds sound during breeding season, migration, and beyond.\n\nSound ID continues to improve and expand, and now includes hundreds of new species across Central and South America, Australia, Asia, and Africa.\n\nNearby places now include photo thumbnails, making it easier to browse and recognize birding hotspots near you.",
